en:
"If ya wanna go any further,
ya gotta collect three medals."{w}{p}"The medals are scattered
all over this floor!{w}Let's go find 'em -- the Joker Land Medals!"{w}

{0E}*      Authorized personnel only beyond this point      *
*              Joker Land Administration Office               *
*                       Office hours: from 7 PM                       *{0F}{w}

A single troll stands there
like an ornament.{w}The troll stares at you in silence.{w}{p}Its huge body fills the whole passage;
there's no way to slip past it.{w}{p}The troll looks away from you
and slowly raises its club.{w}

"Precisely.{w}We cut notches into every desk and chair,
rigged so they split in two -- unnaturally cleanly."{w}{p}"In this way, we produce a show that is safe and yet full of thrills."{w}{p}"And all the bloodshed will be fake.{w}We place capsules of stage blood all over,
so that as they play, they get bloodier and bloodier..."{w}

{0E}"Ugh, honestly! You're all exaggerating!
If someone's in trouble, I help them.{0F}
That's only natural, right?"{w}

{0E}"One way or another, you guys sure know a lot...
I really do need to study.{0F}
And I have to work harder at alchemy, too..."{w}

{0E}"Ninja! Ninja's the way to go!
YAMURU IS DECAPITATED!{0F}
*ding* R.I.P.!"{w}

"You can just go end up
    *INSIDE THE STONE*
all by yourself!"{w}

{0E}"Those two make an Angel's Window...
I know that one, since I've made it before.{0F}
And then Ma... Mazu... Mazu-ree-tay?"{w}

{0E}"Yamuru!{0F}
...It's all right, okay?"{w}{p}"If I wanted to change classes, I wouldn't be studying alchemy.{w}I'm studying like this because
I decided to keep at it, see?"{w}

"Ah! Don't you run away, you bastard!
I didn't get to lop off a single head!
HEEEADS!!"{w}
